english:
I've put you down for *{service}* on *{when}* (West Africa Time).

Reference: #{ref}

If that time doesn't work, just say *"reschedule"* and I'll move it.

current_yo:
Mo ti ṣe ìforúkọsílẹ̀ *{service}* fún ọ ní *{when}* (àkókò Nàìjíríà).

Nọ́mbà ìtọ́kasí: #{ref}

Tí àkókò náà kò bá bá ọ mu, sọ *"reschedule"* kí n yí i padà.

english:
✅ Your booking for *{service}* has been successfully cancelled.

Reference: #{ref}

If you paid and would like a refund, please say *"I need a refund"* and I'll raise a request for you.

current_yo:
✅ Mo ti fagi lé ìforúkọsílẹ̀ rẹ fún *{service}*.

Nọ́mbà ìtọ́kasí: #{ref}

Tí o bá ti sanwó tí o sì fẹ́ owó rẹ padà, sọ *"I need a refund"* kí n gbé e kalẹ̀.

english:
Which of these do you need?

{options}

Reply with the number or the name.

current_yo:
Èwo ni o nílò?

{options}

Dáhùn pẹ̀lú nọ́ḿbà tàbí orúkọ.

english:
Here is what I have — please check it carefully before I register you:

• Name: {name}
• Age / DOB: {age}
• Address: {address}
• LGA: {lga}
• Service: {plan}{free}
• Location: {facility}
• NIN: {nin}

Is all of that correct? Reply *yes* to register, or tell me what to change.

current_yo:
Èyí ni ohun tí mo ní — jọ̀wọ́ ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ dáadáa kí n tó forúkọ rẹ sílẹ̀:

• Orúkọ: {name}
• Ọdún / Ọjọ́ ìbí: {age}
• Àdírẹ́sì: {address}
• Ìjọba Ìbílẹ̀: {lga}
• Iṣẹ́: {plan}{free}
• Ibùdó: {facility}
• NIN: {nin}

Gbogbo rẹ̀ tọ̀nà? Dáhùn *yes* kí n forúkọ sílẹ̀, tàbí sọ ohun tí n óò yí padà.

english:
You have more than one coming up. Which would you like to {verb}?

{list}

Reply with the number.

current_yo:
O ní ju ọ̀kan lọ tí ń bọ̀. Èwo ni o fẹ́ {verb}?

{list}

Dáhùn pẹ̀lú nọ́ḿbà.

english:
{heading}Here is what is free:

{list}

Reply with the number that suits you. If none of these work, say *"speak to an agent"* and a colleague will find something else.

